- The skills and agent.md should be in a diff folder. What l mean is that the container inside should have a filesystem per agent and there per user a folder with the skills he wants and the agent md which is the memory with the user so the agent can edit it. Access on runtime will have only in this folder and inside and can create files there in order no edit of other files or source code edit or anything like that. Input file can land there and the agent will be able to read them with execute tool.

## Dialogue Bridge

- Add the pgvector in order to have an embedding for each conversation and then we can use this embedding to find the most relevant conversations for a given query, this will be useful for the retrieval process and memory across chats.

## Agentic UI

- Chart can be visualized with [shadcn/charts](https://www.shadcn.io/charts) and the agent can have a custom tool like the todo tool in order to represent the chart and create a custom AGUI event for the interaction with the chart.
